s one of the most fundamental form elements used to capture user input such as names, emails, passwords, or search queries.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It provides a visual and interactive affordance for text entry while supporting labels, placeholders, icons, descriptions, and validation feedback.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOTextInput/Status":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Status"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput\/Status","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Define all available status for the text input"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MISOTextInput.Status","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Status"}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misotextinput\/status","kind":"symbol"},"doc://MISOComponents/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOTextInput":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOTextInput","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"MISOTextInput","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput","abstract":[{"text":"Text input is a UI element that allows to enter, edit, or select single-line textual data.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Text input is one of the most fundamental form elements used to capture user input such as names, emails, passwords, or search queries.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It provides a visual and interactive affordance for text entry while supporting labels, placeholders, icons, descriptions, and validation feedback.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misotextinput","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOTextInput","kind":"identifier"}]},"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/playing-haptics":{"identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/design\/human-interface-guidelines\/playing-haptics","type":"link","title":"Human Interface Guidelines of Apple","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Human Interface Guidelines of Apple","type":"text"}],"url":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/design\/human-interface-guidelines\/playing-haptics"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOTextInput/Helperlink":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput\/Helperlink","title":"MISOTextInput.Helperlink","abstract":[{"text":"Used to describe the helper link above the helper text.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Helperlink"}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misotextinput\/helperlink","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Helperlink","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://MISOComponents/7SwiftUI4ViewP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP","title":"SwiftUICore.View","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOTextInput/init(_:tableName:bundle:text:placeholder:prefix:suffix:leadingImage:trailingAction:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:status:)-72xdt":{"fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI18LocalizedStringKeyV","text":"LocalizedStringKey","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tableName","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bundle","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSBundle","text":"Bundle","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text"